<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
    <title>Raport PIT-38 za {{ report.taxYear }}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/app.css') }}">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('css/print.css') }}" media="print">
    <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
</head>
<body class="printable">
<main class="container container--wide">
    <header class="print-header">
        <h1>Raport pomocniczy do PIT-38 za {{ report.taxYear }}</h1>
        <p class="muted">Wygenerowano lokalnie przez {{ app_name }}. Dokument nie został nigdzie zapisany.</p>
    </header>

    {# `expanded` keeps every disclosure open, so nothing is missing on paper. #}
    {% include '_partials/report_body.html.twig' with {expanded: true} %}

    <footer class="print-footer">
        <p class="disclaimer">Zastrzeżenie: {{ disclaimer }}</p>
    </footer>

    {#
        Only a script can open the browser's print dialog - no link or form does
        it. So the button ships `hidden` and app.js reveals it; with JavaScript
        off the shortcut line stays instead. A visible button that does nothing
        would be worse than no button at all.
    #}
    <p class="actions no-print">
        <button type="button" class="button button--primary" data-action="print" hidden>Drukuj</button>
        <span class="print-hint" data-role="print-fallback">
            Drukowanie uruchamia przeglądarka: naciśnij <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<kbd>P</kbd>
            (na Macu <kbd>⌘</kbd>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<kbd>P</kbd>) albo wybierz „Drukuj” w jej menu.
            Ten raport jest już w całości rozwinięty, więc wydruk nic nie pominie.
        </span>
        <a class="button button--plain" href="{{ path('app_calculator') }}">Wróć do kalkulatora</a>
    </p>
</main>
<script src="{{ asset('js/app.js') }}" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
